{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026zfqU2BONa61794216615.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>元朗一間食肆因為食物室不潔等原因多次違反規例，被食環署取消牌照，須即時停業。</p><p></p><p>被取消牌照的是「光榮冰室」，位於元朗康樂路兆明樓地下。食環署指，食肆持牌人因食物室不潔，及未有妥善維修其衞生設備，屢次違反《食物業規例》。今年8月8次被法庭定罪，共罰款4,000元，以及被食環署違例記分65分，食肆因此被取消牌照。</p><p></p><p>署方發言人提醒，食物業處所持牌人必須遵守《食物業規例》、發牌及持牌條件，否則牌照可能被暫時吊銷或取消。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-09T10:01:35.989712+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":206,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-09T09:23:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-09T10:56:08.446641+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-09T09:55:28.018977+00:00","content_hash":"38ecde22efb7ed7b170bc7f20040fa6ba47535cba5f59c496c70e849b23bc4e5","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-09T10:01:35.989712+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}